+# Accounts Service
+
+Terms used by the customer-account API and its back-office staff workflows.
+
+## Language
+
+**Account note**:
+A staff-authored record attached to a customer account, preserving the author, text, visibility classification, and creation time.
+_Avoid_: account comment
+
+**Internal note**:
+An account note intended only for support staff and administrators, never for the customer.
+_Avoid_: private note
